          "expression": "If (DitherScreenCoord & TileWrapMask) == TileJitter and SampleWeightSum > 0.1: WriteOffset = InterlockedAdd(Allocator[0],1); if WriteOffset < BufferSize: Buffer[WriteOffset] = PackedFeedback",
